      {"text":"These potatoes sound like glass, and your oven isn't invited.","captions":["THESE POTATOES","SOUND LIKE *GLASS*","NO OVEN"]},
      {"text":"Boil one pound of baby potatoes in heavily salted water until knife tender.","captions":["1 LB BABY POTATOES","HEAVILY SALTED WATER","UNTIL *KNIFE-TENDER*"]},
      {"text":"Drain, then shake them hard.","captions":["DRAIN","SHAKE THEM *HARD*"]},
      {"text":"Those ragged edges become the crunch.","captions":["RAGGED EDGES","BECOME THE *CRUNCH*"]},
      {"text":"Drop them into hot oil, and don't touch them until deeply golden.","captions":["INTO HOT OIL","DON'T TOUCH","UNTIL *DEEP GOLD*"]},
      {"text":"Garlic and butter go in for the final minute.","captions":["GARLIC + BUTTER","FINAL *60 SECONDS*"]},
      {"text":"Parmesan. Parsley. Flaky salt.","captions":["PARMESAN","PARSLEY","FLAKY SALT"]},
      {"text":"Creamy center. Shatter crisp shell. Save this before dinner.","captions":["CREAMY CENTER","*SHATTER-CRISP* SHELL","SAVE THIS"],"caption_size":104}
    ]
